  1236→///
  1237→/// Formula: For SH degree d, the total number of coefficients is (d + 1)²
  1238→/// - Degree 0: (0+1)² = 1 coefficient
  1239→/// - Degree 1: (1+1)² = 4 coefficients
  1240→/// - Degree 2: (2+1)² = 9 coefficients
  1241→/// - Degree 3: (3+1)² = 16 coefficients
